				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				5725
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ βίου ξ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IGRom.</u>
					4.1215
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1102
			</span></i>, al.</div>
